{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_title", "source_sha256": "6a0080925a5f119e88771d989ad166deddaeded5cacf4e5cb34ed968e12596f9", "ja": "恋するキモチ", "zh": "恋慕的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_synopsis", "source_sha256": "430c193a36819e0a21dcd0dcea074a3332430bf113388dc6a85b1fa273456f22", "ja": "新曲公演で瑞希が披露する事になったのは、\n恋の歌。表現に悩む瑞希を励ますプロデュー\nサーに、公演の後に話したい事があると言う\n瑞希。大盛況のライブ後、瑞希は、今はやめ\nておきます、と言って微笑むのだった。", "zh": "瑞希在新曲公演中要表演的，是一首\n情歌。面对因表现手法而烦恼的瑞希，制作人\n给予了鼓励，而瑞希则表示在公演后有话想对\n他说。在反响热烈的演出结束后，瑞希却微笑着\n说，现在还是先不说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1000_p", "source_sha256": "161dad4055b4cfa7de8200ebc85a6dd49486d60b071177e2286dd858f64030f8", "ja": "（瑞希の新曲披露は、盛大な拍手で幕を下ろした。\n新しい瑞希の一面、しっかり届いたみたいだな！）", "zh": "（瑞希的新歌演出在盛大的掌声中落下了帷幕。\n看来全新的瑞希，已经好好传达给大家了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "a7cc7746ab7334ddeeefcb53f36f1cb16b7011a6507742db40af070bce2c005c", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\n{$P$}。今、戻りました。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……\n{$P$}。我回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "8459470e9798e1d8aa8237f41c0c3503498d5ada0120d13faa827acac7105797", "ja": "私のステージ、どうでしたか。\n……ちゃんと届いたかな。", "zh": "我的舞台表演怎么样？\n……有好好传达给大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0a65fafdc8db917c47ac7c07a3dafede1c04821674a58b99af29f223a2866aff", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希！　ああ、ちゃんと\n届いていたと思うよ。お客さんも盛り上がってただろ？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希！啊，我觉得确实传达到了。观众也都很兴奋吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "0186fc077f7568652b00517f0b74006803c3752b5820d4e170a7368e93d1fefe", "ja": "高坂さん達が、たくさん盛り上げてくれましたから。\nそれと……。", "zh": "多亏高坂小姐她们把气氛炒得非常热烈。\n还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "9a62cfe52c9aa24fcc2620b497737e3af3ac8c52aeccba6e6df801a44cd9456a", "ja": "う～、ステージもう終わっちゃったノ？　さみしいヨ！\nワタシ、もっとみんなとダンスしたかった～！", "zh": "呜～，舞台已经结束了呀？好寂寞哦！\n我还想和大家一起多跳一会儿舞～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "02d8468477c41910bea02ac61c974a933e38fa9700cec9f1f5243a63f3f94ae9", "ja": "うんうん、とっても楽しいステージだったもんね♪\n瑞希ちゃん、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "嗯嗯，毕竟刚才的舞台真的好开心呢♪\n瑞希，真的辛苦你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "55b124d961654006ad203a4f4dbe325ded20f4e8e2136f90e49749b626188617", "ja": "島原さん、佐竹さん、ありがとうございます。\n私も、とても楽しかったです。", "zh": "岛原小姐、佐竹小姐，非常感谢你们。\n我也玩得非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1d87644e5127d736618f597acdd594c2793f4375d60a6f734778affc226e18d", "ja": "みずきん、お疲れさまーっ！　今日のステージ、\n楽しかったっ！　アイドルーって感じで☆", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦啦——！今天的舞台好开心！很有偶像的感觉☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c5fcf73f17c47e5eb8a4915a25ddf4e2ed08d984190b085c3fb05b5e6277e66", "ja": "うん。この曲は、ミキが歌わなくて正解だったね。\n瑞希に似合ってたと思うな。", "zh": "嗯。这首歌没让美希唱真是太好了。\n我觉得很适合瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "8e6249d5275d20e10c9498978fc0d3746a8f883074a5540bfce04177977a4d94", "ja": "高坂さん、星井さん……。\nみなさん、本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "高坂小姐、星井小姐……\n真的非常感谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a983e04de2247e4f4cb98186818c054d7395f45ae07821cce479ff049401e6a", "ja": "みんな、本当にお疲れさま！\n打ち上げするから、早く着替えてくるといい。", "zh": "大家真的辛苦了！\n等下要开庆功宴，你们快去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "de0662b983f69094c11613a83fe971db5f5d53f9338309a10526b013ebb62277", "ja": "打ち上げ、やったー！\nワタシもうお腹ペコペコだヨ～。", "zh": "庆功宴，太棒啦！\n我肚子已经饿扁啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "900839be9dcaee0c2024ccce23a44d1bcf3ecdc3c8ec0745392f648a19732ce3", "ja": "大変、カロリーが逃げちゃう！\nエレナちゃん、急いで着替えようね！", "zh": "糟糕，卡路里要溜走了！\n艾莲娜，快点换好衣服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b22f294b1f32c163a0cdd662dcd28a17f2e0a027d91d654f0a83e0c09aed0e67", "ja": "瑞希は行かないのか？　……あ、そうか。ステージが\n終わったら、話したいことがあるって言ってたっけ。", "zh": "瑞希不去吗？……啊，对了。你之前说过，演出\n结束后有话想跟我说来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1e551c35b9ac4f6afb3961da953aaf48a136d9063482491756ffacd6cc342b8", "ja": "はい。\n……ですが、今はやめておこうと思います。", "zh": "是的。\n……不过，我想现在还是先算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0f256d8c82bf1ffc72732593502f742b5b110ea3e2fa3601d798d54845511efa", "ja": "え？　けど、いいのか？\n何か、大事な話だったんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶？可是，这样真的好吗？\n那应该是很重要的事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "ed99661e984dec1d58408cc47a3009c47e225d703024a9bb3aeb3e152d015c51", "ja": "はい。とても大事な話です。けど私は、まだまだ……\n未熟な、{$P$}のアイドルなので。", "zh": "是的，是非常重要的话。不过我还只是……\n一个不够成熟的、{$P$}的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "871edbc2d8140eb866b2290d57d914a8131f4524479486a9805de35113032332", "ja": "だからいつか、言えるようになったら。\nその時は、聞いてください。……約束。", "zh": "所以，等到有一天我能说出口的时候。\n到那时，请听我说……约好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7fafcbe5895b3e29bfd892ec96ef5f6d57c3bffbc2b71322622af24ebf5e0d61", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n約束だ！", "zh": "啊，我知道了。\n约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2f248150842f77e5f516218230fa903cc9ff504e87437519cbdeb4b1fbde227", "ja": "それでは私も、着替えてきます。\n……打ち上げ、楽しみです。", "zh": "那么我也去换衣服。\n……我很期待庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7a692795e3b617eb868b6c38e196ccd663c50b3bd5e76689fb183239c55717a6", "ja": "（一見わかりにくいけれど、瑞希は感情が豊かだ。\nクールに見えて情熱的な一面も、そのひとつ……）", "zh": "（瑞希乍看之下不太容易理解，但其实感情十分丰富。看起来冷静，却也有热情的一面，这就是其中之一……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_050_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_050_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8b308fe63ddec8136ae60bafafb6d2b9230fde95ce137d60512dbf9c756e8756", "ja": "（瑞希の中にある様々な表情を見逃さないよう、\nプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（为了不漏掉瑞希丰富多彩的表情，\n好好培养她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
